			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Ranjit"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 716670101,
					"content": "Ah, it's you two! I've been waiting for ages!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670102,
					"content": "Befriended the Pyro Regisvine yet?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 716670103,
					"content": "Agh, don't even talk about it. You \"negotiated\" a period of calm... a very, very brief one.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670104,
					"content": "The moment it recovered, it started trying to bump me off again! ... You know what? You were right. It's not possible to make friends with this creature.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670105,
					"content": "Still, its fruit does taste pretty good — like Pyro, in fact. Reckon my Natlan friends will like it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670106,
					"content": "What does that even taste like...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670107,
					"content": "Wanna give it a try? If you want, I could...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670108,
					"content": "E—Err, yeah, no, it's fine! Anyway, are you gonna move on to a Primo Geovishap next?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670109,
					"content": "That's right. I think this one's a winner, to be honest. Primo Geovishaps are quite like the Tepetlisauri, after all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670110,
					"content": "If you travel to Natlan from Sumeru like I did, I reckon they'll be one of the first things you'll meet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670111,
					"content": "Sure, whatever you say. Paimon doesn't have high hopes for this one either, though... Why couldn't you have gone with the Hatchlings?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670112,
					"content": "...They don't have round tummies.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670113,
					"content": "What?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670114,
					"content": "Geovishap Hatchlings don't have round tummies. I imagine it's all that incredibly quick rolling they do. That can't leave you much of a chance to store up fat...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670115,
					"content": "*sigh* But the main reason's still the lack of... impact. What's a Hatchling to those friends of mine who live alongside Saurians?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670116,
					"content": "But a Primo Geovishap, now that's a different story. Even as a tale, it'll be worth the time of day. And anyway, a strong protagonist's gotta have strong opponents, you dig?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670117,
					"content": "Alright. Let's not tarry, shall we? The Primo Geovishap awaits!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670118,
						716670119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				},
				{
					"id": 716670118,
					"content": "Let's away, good sir.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 716670119,
					"content": "I've got other things to handle. See you in a bit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						716670120
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 716670120,
					"content": "No worries. I'll wait for you here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Ranjit"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}